<h3 id='2-determine-the-most-tedious-tasks'  id="boomdevs_20" class="wp-block-heading" >2. Determine the most tedious tasks</h3>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Identifying and automating the most time-consuming tasks in customer support can immensely boost efficiency. When automated, tasks like data entry, scheduling, and basic customer queries can free up valuable time for your team to focus on building better <a href="https://yellow.ai/blog/build-customer-relationship/">customer relationships</a>.</p>


